* ES-7 fixture: READ RESULT SET with loop body and LOOP terminator (reporting mode)
* Demonstrates READ RESULT SET parsing with reporting-mode loop form.
* - CALLDBPROC to establish a result set
* - READ RESULT SET loop with body
* - Terminated with LOOP (reporting mode, not END-RESULT)
* - Zero diagnostics expected for valid syntax

DEFINE DATA LOCAL
  1 #RS (A20)
  1 #ROW (A100)
END-DEFINE

CALLDBPROC 'GET_DATA'

READ RESULT SET #RS INTO #ROW
  PERFORM PROCESS-ROW
LOOP

END
